---
import Curve from "../components/Curve.astro";
import "../css/reset.css";
import "../css/global.css";
import "../css/index.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Affordable small business websites starting at $150/month. Custom web development and technical consulting from an experienced software engineer."
    />
    <title>Starburst Digital</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="flow">
      <h1 class="ml-md-sm mt-l-xl">Starburst Digital</h1>
      <nav class="b-primary">
        <ul class="cluster ml-md-sm" role="list">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="section spot-color-primary">
        <div class="section__inner">
          <div class="wrapper flow region">
            <h1>Get Your Small Business Online for $150/Month</h1>
            <p>
              I build custom websites that help small businesses compete online
              without breaking the bank. No huge upfront costs. No cookie-cutter
              templates. Just a professional web presence you can afford and
              actually use.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="/contact">Get started today</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <Curve />
      </div>

      <article class="region wrapper">
        <h2>Why Work With Me?</h2>
        <ul class="grid" data-layout="50-50" role="list">
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Human Expertise</h3>
            <p>
              I'm a real software engineer with real experience—not a template
              factory or AI content mill. Every line of code is written with
              your business in mind.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you work with me, you're talking directly to the person
              building your site. No account managers, no outsourced development
              teams, no chatbots. Just straightforward communication and
              technical know-how you can rely on.
            </p>
            <p>
              I've been writing code professionally for years, and I bring that
              same rigor and craftsmanship to every small business website I
              build.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Performance Optimization</h3>
            <p>
              Fast-loading, efficient websites that rank well in search engines
              and keep visitors engaged. I build for speed and results.
            </p>
            <p>
              Your customers won't wait around for a slow website—studies show
              that every extra second of load time costs you visitors and sales.
              I optimize images, minimize code bloat, and use modern web
              standards to deliver sites that load in under a second.
            </p>
            <p>
              Fast sites rank better on Google, convert better, and cost less to
              host. Performance isn't an afterthought—it's built in from the
              start.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Internationalization Support</h3>
            <p>
              Need to reach customers in multiple languages? I can build your
              site to support global markets from day one.
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you're targeting Spanish-speaking customers in your local
              market or expanding internationally, I'll set up your website with
              proper language support, locale-specific formatting, and
              translation workflows.
            </p>
            <p>
              No bolted-on plugins or half-working solutions—just sites built
              the right way for multilingual audiences.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>No Vendor Lock-In</h3>
            <p>
              Your content, your domain, your customer data—it all stays yours.
              Unlike Squarespace or Wix, you're not trapped in a proprietary
              platform that controls your business.
            </p>
            <p>
              I build sites on open web standards, which means your content is
              portable and you're not subject to arbitrary price hikes, forced
              feature restrictions, or platform policy changes that could hurt
              your business overnight.
            </p>
            <p>
              If your needs change or you want to move in a different direction,
              you won't have to rebuild from scratch. Your digital presence is
              yours to control.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div class="section spot-color-secondary">
        <Curve />
        <div class="section__inner">
          <article class="flow region wrapper">
            <h2>Experience You Can Trust</h2>
            <p>
              I've spent years building software that people depend on—from
              mission-critical systems used by first responders to real estate
              management platforms and marketing analytics tools. I bring that
              same level of reliability and attention to detail to every small
              business website I create.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <Curve />
      </div>

      <article class="flow region wrapper">
        <h2>Services</h2>
        <div class="grid" data-layout="50-50">
          <div class="flow card" data-flow="sm">
            <h3>Small Business Websites</h3>
            <p>
              A professional website designed specifically for your business. No
              templates, no bloat—just clean, fast, and effective web design
              that helps you get found and get customers.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Pricing:</strong> $150/month with zero down payment. Pay as
              you grow.
            </p>
            <p><strong>What's Included:</strong></p>
            <ul class="flow" data-flow="sm">
              <li>Custom branded website design</li>
              <li>Domain name management</li>
              <li>Responsive mobile-friendly design</li>
              <li>Content management system</li>
              <li>Basic SEO optimization</li>
              <li>Hosting and maintenance</li>
              <li>Regular updates and security patches</li>
              <li>Translation services (available for an additional fee)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flow card" data-flow="sm">
            <h3>Technical Consulting</h3>
            <p>
              Need strategic guidance on a technical decision? Platform
              evaluation? Code review? I offer hourly and project-based
              consulting to help you make smart choices without hiring
              full-time.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Pricing:</strong> Starting at $120/hour. Weekly and Project
              rates available.
            </p>
            <p><strong>What's Included:</strong></p>
            <ul class="flow" data-flow="sm">
              <li>Full access to my expertise and experience</li>
              <li>Strategic planning and recommendations</li>
              <li>Technology and platform guidance</li>
              <li>Ongoing support and advice</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="flow region wrapper">
        <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
        <p>
          Let's talk about your project. I'll give you straight answers, honest
          timelines, and a plan that actually fits your budget.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">Contact me today</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
